      "id": "DIAL_Z07.DDX#1",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tDays passed.\n\tDisliking the exposed feeling created by the defile, they moved quickly during the nights and left the days to resting under rocky overhangs and listening for assassin's footsteps. At last, footsore and road weary, they emerged near the town of Hawk's Hollow.\u0000",
